{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "project-offnetwork-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.55, PENDING: `project-offnetwork`, a PROJECT-domain run whose off-network link carries the processes ProjectTAG feeds from offNetworkLink beyond starts. It selects source types 21 (gasoline) and 62 (diesel), road types 1 and 4, Total Energy for running exhaust, extended idle and APU, and THC for evaporative permeation, fuel vapor venting and fuel leaks. Its 650 MOVESOutput rows are running exhaust on link 1, the three evaporative processes on both links, and extended idle and APU on the off-network link 2.\n\nWHAT IT WAITS ON. Two of ProjectTAG's outputs this model does not compute, and what reads them: (1) the evaporative processes' project activity -- SHP (offNetworkLink.vehiclePopulation x parkedVehicleFraction x ageFraction x noOfRealDays, on the off-network link) and SourceHours (that on the off-network link, the link-volume product WITHOUT the travel-time share on an on-network one), both reproduced in pandas from the execution database's inputs (docs/project-tag.md §6.5) but not ported, and EvaporativeEmissionsOperatingModeDistributionGenerator's and TankTemperatureGenerator's PROJECT branches, which are not measured; (2) extended idle's and APU's project hotelling hours -- offNetworkLink.vehiclePopulation x extendedIdleFraction x ageFraction x noOfRealDays x avft.fuelEngFraction, for source type 62 only, per fuel -- reproduced in pandas but not ported, because the model's hotelling activity has no fuel axis and how BaseRateCalculator joins a per-fuel hotellingHours against the source-bin fractions is not yet measured. Evaluated on 2026-11-09 this document gives `run_domainUnported` = 5: the five emitted pollutant-processes without a project generator here (`rspp_hasProjectGenerator`: 111, 112, 113, 9190, 9191), which is the refusal working.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "project-domain"
    ]
  },
